  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-人群定向、DMP 与 RTA\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"当用户需要上传本地数据到DMP数据平台时，使用此功能将处理好的数据文件上传，上传后返回的文件路径可用于调用【数据源创建】创建相应的数据源。若人群包用于营销投放，还需调用【发布人群包】才能生效。\",\"id\":\"dmp.data_source_file.upload\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/dmp/data_source/file/upload/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1696710568556544\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"dmp.data_source.create\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710569089024\",\"reason\":\"上传数据源文件后，需使用返回的文件路径调用此接口创建相应的数据源\",\"relation\":\"后置接口\",\"title\":\"数据源创建\"},{\"id\":\"dmp.audience_package.publish\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710571768844\",\"reason\":\"若人群包用于营销投放，需调用此接口使人群包生效\",\"relation\":\"后置接口\",\"title\":\"发布人群包\"},{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"调用本接口需要使用通过此接口获取的授权access-token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"本接口的应答参数中的返回码和返回信息需参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1696710568556544\",\"title\":\"数据源文件上传\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bvRJnwVN\">当用户需要上传本地数据到DMP数据平台上时，需要处理成符合数据格式要求的文件，使用数据源文件上传功能。用户上传数据源文件后会返回文件路径<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><span style=\"background-color: #dee0e3;\">file_path</span></span></code>，用于调用<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710569089024\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">【数据源创建】</span></a>时创建相应的数据源。如果人群包用于营销投放，必须再调用<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710571768844\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【发布人群包】</a>才能生效</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-CFaG9P15\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/c6c01a202d2a4832aa80eb5abd76bf5c~noop.image?x-expires=2004015873&amp;x-signature=uwyudZoXgOtB9EKWt7dj8dPnx7s%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-DF2JN7ZX%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-cpEpKZdl%5C%22%3E%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E5%8C%85%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%8750M%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-T3kDS89E%5C%22%3E%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E4%BA%8610s%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7kx2%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-DF2JN7ZX%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-bIoH0jDg%5C%22%3E%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E5%8C%85%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%8750M%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-Y7g5LoJI%5C%22%3E%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E4%BA%8610s%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%A4%AA%E5%A4%A7%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-DF2JN7ZX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bIoH0jDg\">压缩包大小不超过50M！</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Y7g5LoJI\">接口限制了10s超时，建议文件不要太大！</li></ul></div></div></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-lSCGTQCF\" id=\"h346b9f0-lSCGTQCF\">一. 文件预处理</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-U2Ya50iZ\" id=\"h490b8bf-U2Ya50iZ\">1.1 数据格式转换</h2><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-oojbD4cL\" id=\"h6f20189-oojbD4cL\">DMP上传数据格式</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-ePFlSw9g\">Protocol Buffers（简称protobuf）是一种轻便高效的数据序列化格式，可用于结构化数据的序列化和反序列化。它由Google开发并开源，用于解决数据交换和存储的通用问题。DMP上传文件<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>只支持protobuf的数据格式</strong></span>。现况支持 IMEI_MD5、IDFA_MD5、MOBILE_HASH_SHA256、OAID_MD5的数据类型。</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22ProtoBuf%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22syntax%20%3D%20%5C%22proto2%5C%22%3B%5Cnpackage%20toutiao.dmp%3B%5Cnoption%20java_outer_classname%20%3D%20%5C%22DmpDataProto%5C%22%3B%5Cnmessage%20DmpData%20%7B%20%2F%2F%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%AF%8F%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AAbase64%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%9A%84DmpData%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%E4%B8%B2%5Cn%20%20repeated%20IdItem%20idList%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%201%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AF%8F%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E7%9A%84idList%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%8710000%5Cn%7D%5Cnmessage%20IdItem%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20optional%20uint32%20timestamp%20%20%3D%201%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E8%8B%A5%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%EF%BC%8C%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%BA%E6%AD%A4%E6%9D%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%97%B6%E9