aid%20%E5%8E%9F%E5%80%BC%E5%81%9A%20md5%20%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G5zzZ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content ProtoBuf\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-cEqvBZNi\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-dm98d2Uo\"><strong>将上述内容拷贝到文档，存储成dmp_message.proto文件，并根据技术栈生成对应的代码文件(需要安装protobuf编译器)。</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-j3JWbz7O\"><br/></p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22Shell%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20python%20%5Cnprotoc%20--python_out%3D.%2F%20dmp_message.proto%5Cn%23%20java%5Cnprotoc%20--java_out%3D.%2F%20dmp_message.proto%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n5j8M%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content Shell\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-1TBjOKoq\"><br/></p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-3g6500DB\" id=\"hce1b53f-3g6500DB\">代码示例</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-bQyn8F26\">本块内容展示如何将本地文件转成符合要求的数据格式文件，protobuf编译器版本和技术栈依赖包相匹配。注意的是 设备号中IDFA的设备号保持原来格式，<span style=\"color: #d83931;\">OAID｜IMEI的设备号需要小写处理</span><span style=\"color: #8f959e;\">。 </span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-2arREWBV\"><br/></p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-hbgJGcX2\" id=\"h7723ecd-hbgJGcX2\">Python代码实现</h5><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22Python%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20-*-%20coding%3A%20utf